			"date": "2025-02-27T22:19:32.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> i also think we could decouple that from eleventy since it bears little relation- i do think that relation to eleventy should matter in terms of namespacing.</p>",
